Scope of this file

The MIT terms above cover the program: everything under cmd/ and internal/,
and the remaining source tree. It is an independent Go implementation, not a
translation of any earlier work; NOTICE.md records the measurements behind
that statement.

They do NOT cover registers.yaml. That file is a separate work, derived from
croedel/MTECmqtt, and stays under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 3 or later — see LICENSE.registers. The program reads it from the
filesystem at run time; it is not compiled into the binary.
